			"notes": "# Title Awa\n轻量Fabric服务端模组，自动给暂离玩家在头顶名称、Tab列表添加自定义AFK前缀，支持彩色代码、配置热重载，无需客户端安装。\n\n## 核心功能\n1. 自动AFK判定：静止达到设定时长显示前缀，移动立刻清除\n2. 自定义前缀：文字、颜色、计时均可在配置修改\n3. 热重载：控制台指令刷新配置，不用重启服务器\n4. 仅服务端生效，原版客户端全兼容\n\n## 安装要求\nFabric Loader 0.18.4+、Fabric API 0.152.1+（MC 1.26.2）\n1. jar放入服务端mods文件夹\n2. 启动生成config/title_awa.json\n3. 修改配置后执行重载指令生效\n\n## 配置示例\n```json\n{\n  \"afk\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"seconds\": 60,\n    \"prefix\": \"&7[AFK] \"\n  }\n}\n```\n- enabled：开关功能\n- seconds：静止判定秒数\n- prefix：前缀，&为颜色代码\n\n## 指令\n`title reload` 重载配置，仅服务端控制台可用\n\n## 效果\n静止满设定时间后，Tab与头顶名称显示 `[AFK] 玩家名`，移动即消失\n\n持续更新新功能\n\n---\n\n# Title Awa\nA lightweight Fabric server-side mod that adds a customizable AFK prefix to player nametags and Tab list. Supports color codes and live config reloading; no client-side mod required.\n\n## Core Features\n1. Auto AFK Detection: Prefix shows after set idle time, removed instantly once the player moves\n2. Customizable Prefix: Edit text, colors and idle timer in config\n3. Live Reload: Refresh config via server console command without restarting\n4. Server-only, fully compatible with vanilla clients\n\n## Requirements\nFabric Loader 0.18.4+, Fabric API 0.152.1+ (for MC 1.26.2)\n1. Place the mod JAR into your server's `mods` folder\n2. Launch server to auto-generate `config/title_awa.json`\n3. Modify config and run reload command to apply changes instantly\n\n## Config Example\n```json\n{\n  \"afk\": {\n    \"enabled\": true,\n    \"seconds\": 60,\n    \"prefix\": \"&7[AFK] \"\n  }\n}\n```\n- `enabled`: Toggle AFK prefix feature\n- `seconds`: Idle time (in seconds) to trigger AFK mark\n- `prefix`: AFK display text; `&` denotes Minecraft color codes\n\n## Command\n`title reload` — Reload configuration, console-only access\n\n## Preview\nAfter staying idle for the set time, players will see `[AFK] Username` in Tab list and overhead nametags. The prefix disappears immediately upon movement.\n\nNew features will be added in future updates."
		},
